{"id": "Df5sVb7hD7g", "title": "Video by fatfendergarage", "description": "A ‘56 engine bay was never meant to hold a Coyote and two turbos.\n\nThe headers are built tight enough to fit a mirrored pair of Garretts beside the wide Gen 2 5.0 block. \n\nThe intercooler system gets its own fluid tanks and a front-mounted heat exchanger, the blow-off valves are relocated, and the MAF sensor was moved to smooth out the air it reads.\n\nPlanning a Coyote swap of your own? \n\nOur mount kits are 20% off through Thursday. \n\nLink’s in our bio.", "channel": "fatfendergarage", "uploader_id": "1689907668", "uploader": "FAT FENDER GARAGE", "timestamp": 1795044763, "like_count": 6875, "comment_count": 100, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1337615055099814a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.752, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNZWbOF4I8r6eQhkm-sjRE9D_KP4Mht6LXosdswaDIlwxZ82F9h8z5Dy95H33--HnJsEl6CGS68fh5PtgTy7qxbEMYl-xl6RvaDhRs.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=BlYaJzhB6mgQ7kNvwFnNMTJ&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=crkX94nE_sDvS-PF6gqh1A&_nc_ss=7a580&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTJyq9NzS_Ld4V6gNnuH6QZJ8Q79fl7kPTJdQ-o1U_lFg&oe=6B03B1DF", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 70.752, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1337615055099814a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t